===Format===
* '''Group Stage 1:'''
** Four single Round-Robin format groups
*** Each group has six teams
*** All teams play each other once
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Top 4 teams from each group advance to Group Stage 2
*** Top 2 teams proceed to the '''High Group'''
*** Next 2 teams proceed to the '''Mid Group'''

* '''Group Stage 2:'''
** Two Double-Elimination format groups
*** Each group has eight teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** All teams from the High Group and the top 2 teams from the Mid Group advance to the Playoffs
*** 1<sup>st</sup> - 2<sup>nd</sup> place teams from the High Group advance to the '''Upper Bracket Semifinals'''
*** 3<sup>rd</sup> - 6<sup>th</sup> place teams from the High Group advance to the '''Upper Bracket Quarterfinals'''
*** 7<sup>th</sup> - 8<sup>th</sup> place teams from the High Group advance to the '''Lower Bracket'''
*** 1<sup>st</sup> - 2<sup>nd</sup> place teams from the Mid Group advance to the '''Lower Bracket'''

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}} ''(1 map advantage to the UB team)''

