===Format===
* '''Regular Season:'''
** Double Round-Robin format league
*** All teams play each other twice
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Top 5 teams proceed to the Playoffs
*** 1<sup>st</sup> place team advances to the '''Upper Bracket Final'''
*** 2<sup>nd</sup> - 3<sup>rd</sup> place teams advance to the '''Upper Bracket Semifinal'''
*** 4<sup>th</sup> - 5<sup>th</sup> place teams advance to the '''Lower Bracket'''
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-TieBreakers">''Click here to show the tie-breaker process''</span>
